  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Добавлена совместимость Eating Animations с продуктами питания из мода Aether, а также с отдельными вариациями из расширений на тему Aether.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость с текстурпаком Bundle</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Расширенная совместимость Eating Animations для других модов [NEO/FORGE]</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Частичная совместимость с другими модами:</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/885/256/256/639148225207339732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/866/256/256/639148221311503481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/873/256/256/639148222209502373.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/875/256/256/639148223190593815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/879/256/256/639148224173941263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1813/752/256/256/639146533871866822.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Добавляет поддержку совместимости для модов с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations (NEO/FORGE)</a> &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a> или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a></strong></p>\n<h3><strong>Совместимость с модами:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Redux</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Поддерживаемые версии:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.19.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.20.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.21.x</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1306308/description_f3e612a3-a589-46d3-8bcd-f164962f29f6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"406\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1306308/description_3b6fc133-1dba-4a5f-b71f-0de7bf8dad87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"270\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
